    <item>
      <title>Writing Music Chords</title>
      <link>/posts/music-chords/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>/posts/music-chords/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;I often struggled to keep chords for songs I played in a handy place. For a couple of years&#xA;I have been maintaining chords in a Google Doc. Given the forgetful person that I&amp;rsquo;m, storing&#xA;all the chords in one place has come as a blessing. Having all the chords in one place has&#xA;helped me to be more organized about my . It has helped me collaborate better with&#xA;other musicians.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
